# Core invariants (Autonomous AI Agent)

## Secrets hygiene
- Never commit `gdrive-credentials.json`, `gdrive-tokens.json`, `*.pem`, `*.key`, or anything under
  `data/*.json` (already gitignored — do not work around that).

## Docker image discipline
- Do not `npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code` inside the image (ships `claude.exe`; Coolify
  unpack hits "no space left on device"). Use `npm install --omit=dev`.
- Do not download Chrome at build time on Coolify.
- If a Coolify export fails on overlayfs, prune builder/images on the **server** — never
  `--volumes` (that deletes persisted data).

## Quality gates
- `root:test` (and any other quality gate) failing blocks merge/deploy — re-run and fix locally,
  do not push a red gate.
